flowchart TD
    %% CoreBase SpecHarness Gate Chain — each layer guards the layer below
    %% Implementation authority: WORKFLOW.md §4, AGENTS.md, context-routes.yaml, harness-config.yaml
    %% Palette: documents/diagrams/source/_shared/palette.md

    ANNO_TOP["READ TOP-DOWN — WHY this line of code exists"]:::anno

    %% ── Layer 1: Constitution ──
    POL["<b>Constitution &amp; Policy</b><br/>corebase-specharness/memories/repo/core-policies.md · corebase-specharness/rules/<br/><em>principles · code design · security rules · project constraints</em>"]:::gate
    ARW1:::arrow

    %% ── Phase 1: Discovery & Research ──
    DISC["<b>Phase 1 — Discovery &amp; Research</b><br/>artifacts/features/&lt;slug&gt;/analysis.md<br/><em>root cause · brownfield mapping · ADI probes · hypotheses</em>"]:::core
    ARW2:::arrow

    %% ── Phase 2: Specification ──
    SPEC["<b>Phase 2 — Specification</b><br/>artifacts/features/&lt;slug&gt;/ (status.md · spec.md · optional proposal.md)<br/><em>problem statement · acceptance criteria (AC-*) · invariants</em>"]:::core
    ARW3:::arrow

    %% ── Phase 3 & 4: Planning & Tasks ──
    PLAN["<b>Phases 3 &amp; 4 — Planning &amp; Tasks</b><br/>artifacts/features/&lt;slug&gt;/ (plan.md · tasks.md · tasks.json)<br/><em>technical design · public seams · T-NNN graph · AC mapping</em>"]:::core
    ARW4:::arrow

    %% ── Phase 5: Implementation ──
    IMPL["<b>Phase 5 — Execution</b><br/>Project source files · tasks.md T-NNN validation proof<br/><em>code changes · locked T-NNN scope · task evidence · extracts</em>"]:::core
    ARW5:::arrow

    %% ── Phase 6: Verification & Closeout ──
    VER["<b>Phase 6 — Verification &amp; Closeout</b><br/>harness-config.yaml · cli.py verify · review.md · Post-Ship Sync<br/><em>mechanical checks · gates · review verdict · session-extracts sync · Done</em>"]:::gate

    %% Arrows down (gating)
    POL --> ARW1 --> DISC
    DISC --> ARW2 --> SPEC
    SPEC --> ARW3 --> PLAN
    PLAN --> ARW4 --> IMPL
    IMPL --> ARW5 --> VER

    %% Right-side gate labels
    POL -.->|constrains ↓| DISC
    DISC -.->|informs ↓| SPEC
    SPEC -.->|specifies ↓| PLAN
    PLAN -.->|breaks down ↓| IMPL
    IMPL -.->|proves ↓| VER

    ANNO_BOT["READ BOTTOM-UP — HOW FAR a single change propagates"]:::anno

